{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42406","headline":"同家兄哭乔侍郎 · 徐锴","name":"同家兄哭乔侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"诸公长者郑当时，事事无心性坦夷。\n但是登临皆有作，未尝相见不伸眉。\n生前适意无过酒，身後遗言只要诗。\n三日笑谈成理命，一篇投吊尚应知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐锴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42406.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42406","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}